safix: flake.safix.users.bob is delegated to flake.safix.organizations.acme by flake.safix.users.bob.managedBy.
mallory is not among the managers named there, so nothing about it was
edited: the check ran before any file was written, and the identity it read
is the one a commit made here would carry.

Declared managers:
  - alice

A manager runs this, or this name joins them — one line under
flake.safix.organizations.acme.managers, committed first.

These refusals bind the cooperative path and are not authorization. The tree is
the authorization: anyone who can commit can edit these declarations by hand,
evaluation refuses structure rather than people, and no delegation record places
a key in any audience. What they buy is that a scaffold and the identity it is
attributed to cannot disagree.
